   "priceMinor": 33500,
   "currency": "USD",
   "availability": "sold_out",
   "description": "A Vintage-Inspired Moonphase That Makes Luxury Attainable Guided by classical watchmaking, the Moonphase is a study in restraint, balance, and quiet complication. Long admired for its poetry as much as its precision, the moonphase has historically been reserved for watches that value elegance over excess. Designed in the True North design studio, this piece draws from mid-century references, soft proportions, considered typography, a dial composed with symmetry and calm. The triple-date function is integrated with intention, its placement timed precisely into the geometry of the dial to preserve clarity, proportion, and classic lines. Every element exists in harmony. Nothing interrupts the composition; nothing competes for attention. Quietly precise. Timeless by design.",
